Real-vehicle OBD-II CAN traces, MIT licensed. Every file is modified from its
source: trimmed to the ISO 15765-4 OBD ids (7DF, 7E0-7EF, 18DB33F1, 18DAxxxx),
one bus per file, and VIN serial digits 12-17 replaced by '0' (in VIN responses
and in padding bytes copied from them). Everything else is byte-exact.

